          "author": "Heidi Poelman",
          "description": "Yoto Says: Discover true stories of animals who made history, inspiring us to see how anyone can make a difference.\n\nIt's not just people who can change the world, but animals too! These amazing stories introduce children to the real-life animals who changed history. From a cow that helped save millions to a dog who captured a spy to a bear that inspired stories known the world over, Amazing Animals Who Changed the World teaches that you don't have to be big (or even human!) to make a difference.",
